Error [jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned]: `value` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/ownership/deferred_lambda_capture_reports_once.jet:2:45
    |
  2 | see: fn(value: String) -[]> String { return value }
    |                                             ^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return value.copy()` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `value: ^String`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from value` and return a view derived from `value`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120

Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `value` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/deferred_lambda_capture_reports_once.jet:9:28
    |
  9 |     both(&value, () -> see(value))
    |                            ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&value`) only once, or copy first with `value.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
